  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HR-Ombudsman 2009-11 - Ombudsman 2009-11</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MR-Ombudsman 2009-11</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Continued support to the Bolivian Human Rights Ombudsman&apos;s Strategic Institutional plan 2007-2011. A multi-donor basket fund has been set up in support of the Plan. The Plan is divided in five strategic programs, which are divided in up to five projects. The work of the Ombudsman is considered to be highly relevant in Bolivian society, given its impartiality, professionalism and clear rights-focus.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fortsatt st&#xf6;d till MR ombudsmannens strategiska plan.</narrative>
  </description>
